# chktex configuration for this conjecture. Run from this directory:
#
#     chktex -q -l .chktexrc statement.tex
#
# One warning is suppressed, checked hit by hit on 23 August 2026 rather
# than assumed, with a 100% false-positive rate here:
#
#   3   "You should enclose the previous parenthesis with braces." Fires on
#       the oracle space $[M]^{N}$, on $\{Y_{z}\}_{z}$, on
#       $(\log M / P)^{C}$ and on $\left(\cdot\right)^{C}$, where in every
#       case the sub- or superscript attaches to the bracketed group
#       exactly as intended.
#
# Everything else stays on. As of 23 August 2026 the file is clean under
# this config and `lacheck statement.tex` is silent.

CmdLine
{
    -n3
}
